				<wikidot:authorName>Salculd</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>149619</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Ehn&#8230; from a technical standpoint, it's fine, but conceptually the fact that the entire thing is just a literal interpretation of the phrase &quot;nightmare fuel&quot; doesn't resonate with me at all. It's just too punny for something presumably intended to unnerve. Sorry that I can't think of more helpful criticism; really, if I didn't have a problem with the fundamental concept, I'd like it.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
